"{\n  \"AND\": {\n    \"left\": {\n      \"AND\": {\n        \"left\": {\n          \"AND\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"AND\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"Have a known respiratory disorder\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"OR\": {\n                        \"left\": {\n                          \"raw_text\": \"or signs of other respiratory disorders\"\n                        },\n                        \"right\": {\n                          \"raw_text\": \"such as asthma, lung cancer, sarcoidosis, tuberculosis, lung fibrosis, cystic fibrosis, bronchoectasis.\"\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"Have a known history of significant inflammatory disease\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"such as rheumatoid arthritis and systemic lupus erythematosus.\"\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"OR\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"Be severely alpha-1-antitrypsin deficient\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"(PI SZ or ZZ).\"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        \"right\": {\n          \"OR\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"raw_text\": \"Have undergone lung surgery\"\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"raw_text\": \"or scheduled for surgery.\"\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"right\": {\n      \"AND\": {\n        \"left\": {\n          \"raw_text\": \"Not receive chronic or prophylactic antibiotic therapy\"\n        },\n        \"right\": {\n          \"OR\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"raw_text\": \"Have a serious, uncontrolled disease\"\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"raw_text\": \"likely to interfere with the study or impact on subject safety.\"\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}"